<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Mod id="c4a2e9d1-1400-4b7f-8e63-5d1a9f0c2b77" version="1">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Canarias 1400</Name>
    <Teaser>The Canary Islands before the conquest: seven islands, seven native peoples, settler starts, one natural wonder per island.</Teaser>
    <Description>The Canary Islands in 1400, on a 160x83 hex map (3 km per hex) built from NOAA ETOPO 2022 relief. Guanches, Canarii, Benahoaritas, Gomeros, Bimbaches and the two Majo kingdoms each start from a Settler and a Warrior in the Ancient era at their historical seat; every island has one natural wonder (Teide, Roque Nublo, Caldera de Taburiente, Garajonay, Garoe, Tindaya, La Corona) and a balanced set of strategic resources. Stock rules, normal barbarians, Standard speed, one turn = one year, development capped at the Classical era, domination victory only. Shallow sills link neighbouring islands so that contact starts with Optics. Start it from Mods, Single Player, Scenarios.</Description>
    <Authors>cryptoboy2283</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>NOAA ETOPO 2022, Civ5MapImage, Black Forest Labs FLUX (leader art)</SpecialThanks>
    <AffectsSavedGames>1</AffectsSavedGames>
